WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:37.820
My name is Kurata sana, first year
junior high school student.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.740
Aoki-Award winning writer Mama,
and squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:49.000
My manager and driver, Rei-kun.
He's also my ex-boyfriend.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:56.170
- A mysterious white bat, Babbit.
- Where? Where? Where? In Chinese...

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:01.260
Hayama Akito, a lone wolf who does
karate, now my friend.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:07.190
Matsui Fuka, the girl I met in the
bathroom, now my best friend.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.820
Sana-chan!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:27.040
Working Hard
Recovering From an Injury

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.170
Stop it!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.250
Stop it! Stop it! No!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.920
Sana-chan!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.390
- Nao...
- What are you doing?!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.930
Sana-chan!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:51.900
Naozumi-kun... it hurts...
It was because of our relationship...

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.360
How did they... dare do this?!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:58.990
Oh crap!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.530
Don't do it! Don't do it!
Naozumi-kun!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.030
Let go, Sana-chan!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.080
I side not to do it!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.170
I'm weak...

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.170
Naozumi-kun!
Please don't get mad!

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.630
I'm sorry...

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.800
You think it's okay
if you say sorry? Idiots!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:21.510
Damn you!
What the hell were you doing?!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.760
- Naozumi-kun is scary...
- Scary? Who's scarier now?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.810
Wait!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.680
Stop... you can't!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.930
Damn you!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.980
- I'm gonna kill all of you!
- Naozumi-kun!

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.310
No!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.570
Sana-chan! Does it hurt?

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.330
It's just a bit swollen.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.120
It's swelling?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.790
My fans did this.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.170
I'm fine... I'm fine. I can still...

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.210
My foot really hurts!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.670
Sana-chan!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.640
Get a doctor quickly...
Wait, that's me!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.600
The assistant director
does everything

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.680
The assistant director is a doctor.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.600
This is bad... I think it may be
fractured.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.310
- Fractured?
- We should ask the doctor to check it out.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.360
There's a clinic in the village.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.320
It's fracture
if there is fissure bone.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.490
Bye, I'm off!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.200
Sana-chan!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:32.500
I'm sorry, Sana-chan. I should've
kept my guard up...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.210
But I was leisurely taking a bath
with the monkeys.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.250
It's ok, it's ok,
I was also taken by surprise.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.510
I'll never forgive myself.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.050
Ahh, what a nice hot spring!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.050
Sana-chan is hurt.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.850
What are we gonna do about
the movie?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.930
It's too late to
change actors now...

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.730
Let's continue.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.310
The mood... has improved.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.110
Ah. Wrong spelling.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.900
I think your leg has suffered
some stress.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:03.860
Some stress?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.660
Don't push her too hard.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.450
So she needs rest?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.120
Well, it's not that bad.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.200
What does that mean?!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.160
You should be careful next time.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.120
That's all then, it's 2 AM.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.090
If you want to sleep
then you should go to bed.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.380
Oh yeah, just take that other
room for the night.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.470
- So we should sleep here?
- I didn't mean it like that...

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.310
You'll have to quit the movie,
Sana-chan.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.400
What are you talking about?
I won't quit!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.400
Sana-chan!
Does it hurt badly?

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.320
Sana-chan, I don't want you to
work too hard. Why don't you just quit?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:48.320
I'm alright! Don't worry...

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.700
But this is serious.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.410
Mako doesn't run or jump, right?
She just walks around slowly!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.210
- That's true but...
- It'll be fine, I can do it.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.290
- But I'm just saying what if...
- I even protected my face.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.090
- You really...
- I'll use makeup to cover it up.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.340
No way,
I can't let you do this.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.670
No! No! I'm gonna act!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.760
When I decide to do something,
I'm gonna do it till the end.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.550
I don't care what you say! I won't
agree! No!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:12.680
Shimura-san has a hand fracture,
but she still goes all over the place.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.020
That wasn't a fracture, Sana-chan!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:20.440
Rei-kun, I don't want to give my
part to someone else.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:26.820
Sana-chan, I want you to do a good
job on the movie.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.070
But...

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.990
Please, Rei-kun, let me continue
acting in the movie like this.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.700
I'm not gonna do anything that's
bad for me.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.290
If I can't do it, I'll tell you, ok?

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.500
OK?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.420
What a nice morning!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.340
Is it true that she was in
Yamashita clinic?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.010
Yeah, I heard an old lady said it.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.760
She spent last night
in the clinic.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.350
She's really hurt.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.560
Of course, she was beaten up
pretty badly.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.890
So she shouldn't act in
the movie anymore...

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.810
Yeah, that's what we're hoping for.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.020
But...

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.440
Thank you for taking care of me!

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.490
She's full of energy.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.370
Rei-kun, am I heavy?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.790
You're so heavy I want to fart!
Gero! Gero!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.580
Rei-kun, am I heavy?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.670
You're not that heavy,
you're really light.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.000
I'll prove it to you, I can
run 100 meters carrying you!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.920
Follow them!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.800
Why is he running so fast?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.550
Hey, Rei-kun...

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.970
Yeah?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.180
Don't act worried in front of them because I got injured.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.810
This injury isn't that serious.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.180
Alright, Sana-chan.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.270
She's not gonna stop.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.690
Damn her...

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:50.570
But it makes me mad that
Naozumi-kun's fans did this to you!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.030
I know! That's right!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.450
Right! Right!
Report this crime to the police!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:58.040
Don't! If we do it before the film
finishes, we'll create a ruckus.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.290
But if we don't do something about
this, it's not good.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.040
Wait till the movie's finished!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.330
Fine.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.260
You feel bad now, don't you?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.930
Sana-chan!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.430
Sana-chan! How is it?

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.140
Sana-chan! Are you ok?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.810
I'm alright!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.680
It's only a little injury,
I can go back to work now.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.980
I see, I'm so glad.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.150
Does it hurt really badly?

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.690
I'm alright! I'll do my best!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.570
Sorry for making you all worry!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.570
That's really great.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.860
Sana-chan, if you're hurting
just say so.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.030
We don't want to force you
to do anything.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:39.700
We were all worried but Kamura-kun
was worried the most.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.580
He's been really depressed.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.620
He's really sorry that his fans
hurt you.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.000
Don't think about this too much, Nao!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.750
I've had enough!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.300
I'm quitting!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.380
What are you saying?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:57.050
You have so many good fans,

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.260
the others are only
a small minority.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.930
That's enough! Stop it!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.890
Naozumi...

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.350
Go back to the old days...

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.490
I entered this world because
I adored Sana-chan.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.070
I never thought my fans would do
this to Sana-chan!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:21.450
Boom! Pow! Slam! Bang! A physical
attack!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.000
Nao...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.380
Quitting?

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.840
I absolutely do not accept this!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.510
Sana-chan...

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:44.430
Maeda-san, please leave Naozumi-kun
and me alone for a little while.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.730
Hey, I'm gonna do my best!
You're gonna do your best too, right?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.150
Come on, snap out of it, ok?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.660
I can't snap out of it...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.200
They're really low...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:05.200
Those fans are like the paparazzi
from the weekly magazines.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.170
That's not something you can control.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:14.510
That's a reporter's job... they
have to make a living too!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:19.840
They did such a thing because
those fans like you too much...

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.140
You're just angry but you should
feel sorry for them too!

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.100
You're really great.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:33.110
For you to be able to think this
way... It's unreal.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.360
I can't be like you.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.860
How can you not be angry that
they did this to you?

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.820
What do you mean?
Of course I'm angry!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.990
I wanna rub their noses green and
smash their faces purple!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:47.290
I wanna beat them up until they
have broken skulls and serious broken bones!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.000
I wanna beat them senseless!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.540
But that's not right
so I'm adopting an alternative!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.630
But...

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:57.050
That's right, they beat me up
because they wanted me to quit.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.800
But I won't quit the movie
just because of my injury.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:04.390
Since it'll make them unhappy,
I'm going to act with you in the movie.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:11.020
Because of this, I can concentrate
on making the movie great!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.480
This is their bad luck!
They deserve it!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.400
They're sad.
Mama told me before...

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.620
Sana, enjoy yourself even under
adversity.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.950
Stop it, Sensei!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:29.910
The wise man says "It is harmful to
speak too much, think positive."

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:34.040
But it's easier said than done.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.670
I have a strong body!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.920
Anything I want to do...
I'm gonna do it!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.010
Sana-chan!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.260
Are you alright?

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.510
I'm totally fine.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:49.480
Compared to the pain of giving
birth, this is nothing.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.850
You've had a child before?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.230
No. You've definitely had poke even
if you never saw pigs walk.{checar}

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.730
Who asked you guys?!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:00.320
We actors are imagination experts!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.110
Let's just concentrate on our work!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.370
Yeah.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.900
Now I feel better.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.400
When there's nothing else you can do, just do your best!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.150
I'm sure he would say it like that.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.990
Sana-chan, are you ok?

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.330
Piling up?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.830
Today we're visiting white-hot Mizu
no Yakata movie set filming location.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.210
I feel trouble.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:07.180
What's abiriba?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.180
{parte b}

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.140
It's abiriba!

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.900
Hi, fat fat triangle. A heart on the dripping and draw wings.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.570
That's Babbit.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.110
Help me!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.740
Wake up, you can't die!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.240
Leave me... just go!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.950
How can you just leave me?!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.580
The group in the mountains
suddenly came up with a problem.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.290
Not even the PHS phone works.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:38.290
If you are watching this show,
please hurry and find our target.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.380
What are you saying?

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.340
Is this a dream or hologram?

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.100
There are no people here in the
wilderness of the mountains,

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.310
and out of nowhere comes Sana-chan.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.520
This the front of the movie set.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:58.900
Welcome!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.650
This is Naozumi-kun.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:07.820
This's the boy and girl who are
starring the movie Sana-chan and Naozumi-kun!

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:15.120
I thought Sana-chan would be starving for hunger and have lots to gripe about,

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.500
but she's turned into a cute
darling!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.840
That's because I'm getting
into the character.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.590
Adult! Actress!
This must be your influence.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.180
It's the other way around,
Sana-chan has taught me so much.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.010
Wow! We're not worthy!
We're not worthy!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.930
Zoom shot!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.980
What the magazine says is true!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.730
Jealous! Jealous! Jealous!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.560
That's not true!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.780
We don't have a kicking and
screaming relationship.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.820
It was I who snuck in there!

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.660
This is sounding worse and worse.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.450
Zoom shot!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.870
Those two look really compatible.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.830
Is the feeling between you two
the same?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.540
When she's with the Naozumi-kun,
she's all nice.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.080
Have you ever seen that?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.880
It says they're going out!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.500
What will you do? Is it ok, huh?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.630
They're deep in the mountains
together.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.510
They're probably doing fine.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:15.930
Sorry, sis.
Don't use such impolite words.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.310
Okay you two, let's rehearse.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.560
Ok!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.400
Can you see the bandage on my leg?

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.560
Don't worry,
my clothes will cover it.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.230
I want to thank you for
talking for me, Naozumi-kun.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.400
We're co-stars after all,
I should help you.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.570
True.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.160
- Kamura-san, ok?!
- Ok!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.870
- Sana-chan, ok?!
- Ok!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.910
Scene 61: Mako and Hiroto scene.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.870
Ok... start...

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.460
What are you saying?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.790
What?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:47.710
It's your brother
who did this with me...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.380
NG.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.090
Are you ok, Sana-chan?

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.430
Sana-chan!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.890
I'm alright!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.720
I'm sorry!
Let's do it again, please!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.930
Sana-chan...

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.140
As what Sana said.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:03.310
The filming is going very well.

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.440
Because I was hurt,
I know how it feels...

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:10.400
Sana-chan's acting is really suitable for the role of make who suffered feelings

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.700
of emotional pain which
turned her into a spirit.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.120
Since she got hurt she is able to
get into the character in the movie.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.160
I told you she was simple.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.870
Is this happening around her?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.830
The air seemed to be
thicker than usual.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.710
It's probably nothing.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.510
The feeling of the people working...

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.920
I feel it deeply.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.340
It's like being
stabbed with a knife.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.300
- It sounds like it hurts a lot...
- And it left a big impression.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.720
Anywhere, anytime...

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.770
Use your experience
to improve your acting.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.980
- You...
- You...

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.230
You're so strong!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.230
Cut. Ok.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.110
Sana-chan, here's some painkiller.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.160
Sana-chan, let's stop
and rest for today.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.200
Coming to work immediately
isn't a good idea.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.870
It's ok! It's ok!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.870
No problem- It's Cantonese.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:10.090
It still hurts a bit, but I feel
full of energy inside.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.880
My heart feels happy.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.720
Brown belt. You passed the exam!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.180
Congratulations.
I'm glad for you, Hayama.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.850
Hayama, I'll do my best...

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.230
You do your best too...

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:30.570
Nao... Those girls came to apologize.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:35.240
They said their emotions got out of
control and made them do that.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.990
There's no point in apologizing to me.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.450
They should apologize to Sana-chan.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.410
Yup.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.910
What? What?
They came to apologize?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.710
There's no point,
you don't have to.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:53.420
Even though you're apologizing,
you still hate me, right?

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.590
Well, I hate you too!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.760
Jeez, the kid is provoking again!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.720
Watch me work.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.720
I'm gonna make a great movie
for you to see.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.770
When you realize how much effort
I put into this film,

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.270
you better acknowledge
how hard I worked for it...

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.860
So cool!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:21.830
Sana-chan.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.120
I heard that Sana-chan had a fever.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.630
Yeah, maybe because
she worked too hard.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:32.380
Umm... Can I see her
for a little while?

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.170
Just for a little while.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:54.320
Get better, get better,
get better...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.490
Amayah...

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.200
Backwards?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.450
Amayah...

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.330
Hayama.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:17.010
"Acompany to fall in to sleep,
Naozumi."

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.180
What happened here?

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.720
Is there something between Sana
and Kamura Naozumi?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.720
I never heard Sana-chan say
anything about this.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.770
This says they're lovers.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.020
Something must have happened up in
the mountains...

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.400
No, it happened before...

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.900
You are...

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:37.320
- Big eyebrows, big nose hair...
- That's not right...

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.650
Big eyebrows,

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.740
long eyelashes...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.990
Bloody nose...

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.820
And loves to fart too!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.160
I'm Ishida!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.370
Thick and bloody Ishida-kun,
what did you say?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.420
Actually I told Sana-chan
my feelings before she left.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.500
- You told her?
- Courageous!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.000
Because she had a relationship
with Naozumi-kun, she turned me down.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.840
Wait a minute, are you serious?

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.380
If you're lying, I'll shave off
your eyebrows!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.260
It's true!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.550
You can tell I'm not lying by
looking at my eyebrows!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:09.520
What he meant was look at his eyes...
but we know what you meant.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.100
Sana-chan really told you she and
Kamura-kun are going out?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.520
It's true!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.940
And I thought she looked like she
wasn't interested in anyone.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.860
I told Hayama I would help him
get together with Sana,

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.780
but now can it still happen?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.580
But... I can't believe it.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.990
What will poor Hayama think?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.540
What about me?

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.500
Akito-kun, did you see this?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.040
Don't show it to him!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.590
Oh that, I saw it...
My sister likes that type of news.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.630
So then Akito-kun this...

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:43.180
Don't make such
a big deal out of this.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.050
But Akito-kun, isn't this
important to you?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.720
It was... I don't know...

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.020
What do you mean?

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:56.520
Tsuyoshi-kun had once told me that she'd never neglect lonely vagrant cats.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.610
Oh.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.440
It could be I just got used to
being with someone who took care of me.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.400
I haven't seen her lately,
so I don't know.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:10.240
Even if she has a relationship
with Kamura, it's ok with me.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:14.290
Really, is it really ok?

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.880
Just forget about it already.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.050
After class...

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.510
Hayama Aki! Wait up!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:28.850
What?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:32.100
Do you want me to pretend to be
your dad this time?

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.850
You big idiot!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.810
Me and my Osaka friends
discussed it...

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:39.770
Takaishi-kun and Shizu-chan make
a really good couple.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:44.190
I was worried that they'd be
uncomfortable with me.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.280
I can finally breathe
a sigh of relief.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.320
Good!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.280
Really, I'm relieved now.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:54.000
And my relief is
really thanks to you.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:59.460
I thought if you were my real
boyfriend, it wouldn't be too bad.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.880
But I don't mean to replace Sana.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:06.590
I'm not good enough.

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:28.700
